.TH MOZC_EMACS_HELPER 1 "2026-10-15" "marinaMoji" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mozc_emacs_helper \- marinaMoji conversion helper for the Emacs mozc.el client
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mozc_emacs_helper
.RB [ \-\-suppress_stderr ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mozc_emacs_helper
connects Emacs to the marinaMoji conversion server.
It is started by
.I mozc.el
and is not meant to be run by hand: it reads requests as S-expressions
on standard input and writes the server's responses to standard output.
.PP
The package conflicts with
.B emacs-mozc
and
.BR emacs-mozc-bin ,
since both install a helper with this name.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-suppress_stderr
Discard all output to standard error.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/emacs/site-lisp/emacs-mozc/mozc.el
The Emacs client that runs this helper.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR emacs (1)
.PP
https://github.com/marinaMoji/marinaMoji
